 "lane": "api-routes-overlap",
 "note": "Wave 6 lane api_routes: GET /overlap (R5.21) and PUT/DELETE /overlap/reviews (R6.29), which re-read a row through the same view. Sole tenant: user 1. Redis is each side's own index, so the read's two notes for the sidecar (catalyst_tag:wanted, candidate_review:wanted) are compared key by key.",
 "env": {
  "BASKFY_SOLE_USER_ID": "1"
 },
